sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant A as Agent API
    participant W as Worker
    participant P as Approval Service
    U->>A: 创建任务
    A->>W: 入队(run_id)
    W-->>U: status / partial result
    W->>P: 请求批准外部写操作
    P-->>U: 展示目标、参数与风险
    U->>P: 批准或拒绝
    P-->>W: signed decision
    W-->>U: completed / cancelled / failed
